  m_Name: FieldCommander
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Field Commander
  role: 1
  description: 'A lone officer who makes everyone nearby shoot straighter. Lead from
    the front gives friendly soldiers within 15 m +15% accuracy (the Commander doesn''t
    get it), so keep the Commander just behind your main firing line. With 10 health
    but only a pistol, the Commander isn''t a fighter, and as a Solo unit is a prime
    target for enemy snipers. A Commander: every army needs at least one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 261f39bca7f2c59489776612e04bcf27, type: 2}
